msgid ""
"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Sada izgrađeno na CEF/Chromium 148. Karere 4.0 zamjenjuje WebKitGTK pozadinu "
"Chromium Embedded Frameworkom, donoseći potpunu reprodukciju video privitaka "
"(H.264/AAC), podršku za više računa s izoliranim sesijama, zumiranje po "
"računu te brži, kompatibilniji prikazivački mehanizam uz zadržavanje iste "
"nativne GTK4/libadwaita ljuske."

